health or lack of it can do.

00:18:52.131 --> 00:18:56.578
Who would have thought that the entire
world would go into a lockdown mode?

00:18:56.578 --> 00:18:59.208
I never thought that could
happen in my lifetime.

00:18:59.208 --> 00:19:00.783
So we're invested in that sector.

00:19:00.783 --> 00:19:05.775
