00:26:34.597 --> 00:26:36.471
My message has been consistent.

00:26:36.471 --> 00:26:39.166
We have opportunities in Africa.

00:26:39.166 --> 00:26:42.613
There's huge opportunities in Africa,
a huge population.

00:26:42.613 --> 00:26:46.162
Income per capita is improving, and

00:26:46.162 --> 00:26:50.864
we lack access to electricity
on the continent.

00:26:50.864 --> 00:26:57.317
So as the world mobilizes towards
a more inclusive society,

00:26:57.317 --> 00:27:02.505
right, the world mobilizes
to a more prosperous

00:27:02.505 --> 00:27:07.731
world, I always like to remind people that

00:27:07.731 --> 00:27:12.737
