00:27:12.737 --> 00:27:17.854
with the issue of access to
electricity on the African continent.

00:27:17.854 --> 00:27:23.850
The reason we have youth unemployment
in Africa is attributable to this.

00:27:23.850 --> 00:27:29.268
The reason we have youth restiveness
in Africa is attributable to this.

00:27:29.268 --> 00:27:33.959
The reason some embrace extremism
is attributable to this.

00:27:33.959 --> 00:27:39.220
In fact, government's ability to fight
extremism is also limited by this.

00:27:39.220 --> 00:27:44.500
So, at times you see communities and
large spaces that do not feel

00:27:44.500 --> 00:27:50.260
any impact of government or
society because no access to electricity.

00:27:51.270 --> 00:27:55.140
So it's a major for me,
it's not just an investment.

00:27:55.140 --> 00:27:59.899
A commercial investment is
what we should be doing in

00:27:59.899 --> 00:28:05.320
the 21st century to help
improve access to electricity.

00:28:05.320 --> 00:28:10.957
