00:28:30.068 --> 00:28:32.228
And those who have the focus, so

00:28:32.228 --> 00:28:36.561
that collectively all of us can
make a difference in the Africa.

00:28:36.561 --> 00:28:37.950
&gt;&gt; I want to stay a little bit,

